{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0400_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0400_story_03_title", "source_sha256": "47e35cab5a9a9e514bd5304d58d4d3d608757a02d1ed02a02e591c9c03fcb93a", "ja": "問題解決はsonicに！", "zh": "问题解决要靠sonic！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0400_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0400_story_03_synopsis", "source_sha256": "d3997ea899852059911e603838c9369561560a0964de63c17b06c8db824340df", "ja": "アイドルたちは、ダンス部の亀裂に頭を\n悩ませる。解決策が思いつかない中、\nエレナと海美はある人物からアドバイスを\nもらう。それは不思議な出来事だったが\nプロデューサーは既視感を覚える。", "zh": "偶像们为舞蹈部的裂痕而烦恼。想不出解决办法之际，  \n艾蕾娜和海美从某个人那里得到了建议。那是一件不可思议的事，  \n但制作人却产生了似曾相识的感觉。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0400_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0400_story_03_1000_034ayu", "source_sha256": "4209ddd0c0fa97568afc458fb55e42b4da6aead121f357c57dd9c5712921ec30", "ja": "……あれは、結構根深い問題だよね。\n同じ気持ちでも、熱さに差があるっていうか。", "zh": "……那可是个挺根深蒂固的问题呢。\n虽说心情相同，但在热情上却有差距。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0400_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0400_story_03_1001_043nor", "source_sha256": "55c5a7069bb986950fd91b6e7422d5336ef15b123929e3168275524a3c6f0321", "ja": "うん、賭けてるものの差、なのかな。\n話した感じ、みんな同じ方向を向いてるんだけどね。", "zh": "嗯，也许是赌上的东西不同吧。聊下来，感觉大家的方向都是一致的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0400_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0400_story_03_1002_018ele", "source_sha256": "1e84d44bc9f32405927eae739b2e8914168acd736a641cd9e31bef13d7515128", "ja": "ダンスでケンカになるなんて思わなかったヨ……。\n一緒に踊るだけじゃ、仲良くなれないノ？", "zh": "没想到居然会因为跳舞吵起来耶……  \n只是一起跳舞，还是没法成为好朋友吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0400_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0400_story_03_1003_029umi", "source_sha256": "b1086c5cf9fd73c2aba09578e642b59b4bf878336ddbdccd6e416e16a77d2f56", "ja": "絶対なれると思う！　でも、一緒に踊るためには、\n仲良くしないといけなくて……。", "zh": "我觉得绝对可以！但是，要一起跳舞的话，就必须先成为朋友……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0400_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0400_story_03_1004_034ayu", "source_sha256": "a23ae7cf13e56fe96fcf6c6e290f87b27b572f68142384bb9dd706b0aebcd36d", "ja": "う～～～ん……。", "zh": "嗯～～～……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0400_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0400_story_03_1005_029umi", "source_sha256": "a23ae7cf13e56fe96fcf6c6e290f87b27b572f68142384bb9dd706b0aebcd36d", "ja": "う～～～ん……。", "zh": "嗯～～～……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0400_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0400_story_03_1006_043nor", "source_sha256": "a23ae7cf13e56fe96fcf6c6e290f87b27b572f68142384bb9dd706b0aebcd36d", "ja": "う～～～ん……。", "zh": "嗯～～～……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0400_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0400_story_03_1007_018ele", "source_sha256": "a23ae7cf13e56fe96fcf6c6e290f87b27b572f68142384bb9dd706b0aebcd36d", "ja": "う～～～ん……。", "zh": "嗯～～～……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0400_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0400_story_03_1008_null", "source_sha256": "85bade74398fbeee14a8d8c1adb3a4df6fddb075a9f15db07865ade86f33fbd1", "ja": "ピカッ！", "zh": "闪亮！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0400_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0400_story_03_1009_staff", "source_sha256": "499938eb67fef1f2c86f198e369ee6231d9badee9c182f575fd2ff2df09142fe", "ja": "……あれ？　おかしいな……。すみません、\nカメラのバッテリー交換しますので、いったん休憩で！", "zh": "……咦？奇怪了……不好意思，\n我要更换相机电池，先休息一下！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0400_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0400_story_03_1010_043nor", "source_sha256": "12be70434e5044353945c683885147d48902f8b32d6d203018301479dd95a098", "ja": "ふう……。\nアタシ、ちょっと外の風にあたってくるよ。", "zh": "呼……  \n我去外面吹会儿风。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0400_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0400_story_03_1011_034ayu", "source_sha256": "5e6029766d5ebaac4ee378d4d663e928c8b937c6fd1316b854c6bdf34a0f481a", "ja": "あ、アタシも。\nちょっと身体動かそーっと。", "zh": "啊，我也去。\n稍微活动一下身体吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0400_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0400_story_03_1014_018ele", "source_sha256": "b9c7356dd4d94db59c0b73962775fe3366e9f22562ecbe76eb8bba39ba14070a", "ja": "ねえ、ウミ。\nダンスでみんながハッピーになるって、悪いコト？", "zh": "呐，海美。\n用舞蹈让大家都开心，这难道是坏事吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0400_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0400_story_03_1015_029umi", "source_sha256": "5563d649af3cd80320dd688ea64e7f58ddb9f2d485c2661117c63da82533d421", "ja": "ううん、すごく良いことだと思うよ！　でも……。", "zh": "不会啊，我觉得这是一件非常好的事哦！可是……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0400_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0400_story_03_1016_029umi", "source_sha256": "89368308e036d80e01d2d63df952128aa80833356ae9a6e142e4df7db7e2b558", "ja": "ダンスが好きなほど、いろいろ考えちゃって\n悩んじゃうんじゃないかな……。", "zh": "越喜欢跳舞，就越会想很多，反而会陷入烦恼吧……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0400_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0400_story_03_1017_018ele", "source_sha256": "332886b43d030661024882389792de26335a2118a385d95dfee4e9ace46ff779", "ja": "そっか……そうだよネ。\n好きだから、なんだよネ……。", "zh": "这样啊……确实是呢。\n正因为喜欢，才会这样的呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0400_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0400_story_03_1018_null", "source_sha256": "85bade74398fbeee14a8d8c1adb3a4df6fddb075a9f15db07865ade86f33fbd1", "ja": "ピカッ！", "zh": "闪亮！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0400_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0400_story_03_1019_029umi", "source_sha256": "a90fdcd61ac2ed7a04c5a5f0ec312eb26bc959f0f9135a34aaf56b0194596e9f", "ja": "あれ？　えれなん、今、ピカッて光らなかった？", "zh": "咦？艾莲娜，刚才是不是闪了一下？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0400_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0400_story_03_1020_018ele", "source_sha256": "b17fdb1acb422129ba4ce51a3d1967b01c96c17115c201ea7260d7f27916ac3a", "ja": "ウン……光ったよネ？\n電気の調子が悪いのかナ？", "zh": "嗯……刚才是亮了一下，对吧？\n是不是电路出故障了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0400_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0400_story_03_1021_gekiko", "source_sha256": "a0202b34092079920e769ab1b1851a57ceb1f62ccd441ab29a858e1324e2fef5", "ja": "海美ちゃん、エレナちゃん、久しぶり。", "zh": "海美、艾蕾娜，好久不见。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0400_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0400_story_03_1024_gekiko", "source_sha256": "3ebd832dd7b6a87489e7dd7c2e95f88f62576db80ab7a68081c703fe57c5cce1", "ja": "私だよ、二人とも。げき子。", "zh": "是我啦，你们两个。激子。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0400_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0400_story_03_1025_029umi", "source_sha256": "77cecc4e7e77b6a48cef218c3614d883563f75a2996b9dbb7fe382ca8c93adc4", "ja": "あ……。そっか、げっきーだ！\nえへへ、突然だったからビックリしちゃったよ～！", "zh": "啊……对了，是小剧！  \n嘿嘿，因为太突然了，吓了我一跳～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0400_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0400_story_03_1026_018ele", "source_sha256": "2ac02a29c7757f6ce4c6b97efa81eaa111a22b8db9c014cff265afb7a8dec533", "ja": "久しぶりだネ、ゲキコ♪\n……あれ？　久しぶりって、なんで……？", "zh": "好久不见呀，剧子♪  \n……咦？说起来，为什么会觉得好久不见呢……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0400_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0400_story_03_1027_gekiko", "source_sha256": "b312c6f4d687c34bb69a5137ce1c4a920ac17ea20072c401cf67096801ad0c3c", "ja": "みんなは学校に行ってるからだと思う。\n私は劇場でお留守番だから。", "zh": "我觉得是因为大家都去上学了。\n而我要在剧场看家。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0400_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0400_story_03_1028_029umi", "source_sha256": "7023cbefe7bc339d507749fa5b32988f72841163e53c2b89c8a2f012dc8c2996", "ja": "そっかー。げっきーも一緒に来れたらいいのにね。\nでもでも、会えて嬉しい♪", "zh": "这样啊——要是剧场也能一起过来就好了呢。\n不过不过，能见到你我很开心♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0400_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0400_story_03_1029_gekiko", "source_sha256": "fa03a31a681b157c949e4b18ad451ec331bf54d386c79ec8f2817980b5f66396", "ja": "うん、私も。……ねえ。\n二人とも困ってるみたいだけど、どうしたの？", "zh": "嗯，我也是。……喂。\n\n你们两个好像遇到麻烦了，怎么了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0400_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0400_story_03_1030_018ele", "source_sha256": "0a8170621f1bb31a3255541b6767921b0372255ed6227c4d55b1bb0ac73fdf9a", "ja": "あ、うん……。ワタシ達ね、学校のダンス部と\nコラボするお仕事してるんだケド……。", "zh": "啊，嗯……我们正在做和学校舞蹈社合作的工作，可是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0400_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0400_story_03_1032_018ele", "source_sha256": "75a2d6630386629d13366b58428839d214dfab9aee3c78a1f07828a676c87dd5", "ja": "ダンスは、気持ちを表現する方法だって思うノ。\n仲良くなろー！　楽しもう！　って。", "zh": "我觉得，舞蹈是一种表达心情的方式。\n比如“成为好朋友吧！”“一起开心吧！”……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0400_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0400_story_03_1033_018ele", "source_sha256": "583eb4bbd523a2b9d0b315e54e159fa74835d300c289ff7d24b74bfdfa8977bf", "ja": "だから、みんなの好きな気持ちを\n自分なりに表現するだけじゃダメなのかナ……。", "zh": "所以，只用自己的方式表达大家喜欢的心情，难道还不行吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0400_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0400_story_03_1034_029umi", "source_sha256": "c3411e488f9e13416ff0284ccaf6cbb7c74d28d49b041eda3cd3a54a20c77490", "ja": "えれなん……。", "zh": "艾莲娜……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0400_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0400_story_03_1035_gekiko", "source_sha256": "3ab0616c8fbaf410cee03f13ea0b5519f3f070016d3306fbc8a3830233c89a8c", "ja": "次の定期公演、みんなも出るよね。\nみんなのステージを見てもらうのがいいと思う。", "zh": "下次的定期公演，大家也会参加吧。\n我觉得让大家看看我们的舞台会比较好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0400_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0400_story_03_1036_018ele", "source_sha256": "28cc30e43fe5854f0864eefe2bfc6ec4265b0319698299b54e1b770cba8b1caa", "ja": "えっ？　ワタシ達のステージを？", "zh": "咦？要看我们的舞台？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0400_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0400_story_03_1037_gekiko", "source_sha256": "9a49a08b12922d0e1ae3db93ade4c6c88c706da555d7f903af762fea1a01440c", "ja": "そう。ちゃんと気持ちを表現してるところを見たら、\n踊ってるイメージが具体的になるから。", "zh": "对。看到你确实在表达自己的感情，跳舞时的形象就会变得具体起来。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0400_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0400_story_03_1038_029umi", "source_sha256": "2a85b452abd7fa40ff9a9220908a20bfcdf83a72d18ab49a5efdb102ab7ffd74", "ja": "そっか……共通の目標を作るってことだね！\nさっすが、げっきー！", "zh": "原来如此……就是要设定一个共同的目标！\n不愧是小惠！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0400_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0400_story_03_1039_029umi", "source_sha256": "fe92dc9ada9cae82f1e427cfe64ce659309ac028ea592aaec172d82201e470eb", "ja": "じゃあ早速、{$P$}に相談だー！\n行こう、えれなん、げっきー！", "zh": "那就马上去找{$P$}商量吧——！\n走吧，艾蕾娜、阿翼！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0400_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0400_story_03_1040_gekiko", "source_sha256": "4494fcd6f782c697a63c7fcf35dd1b8b8a5f80b958dbb44c4a261a210d2aed47", "ja": "あ、ごめんね。私、そろそろ行かなきゃ……。", "zh": "啊，抱歉。我差不多该走了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0400_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0400_story_03_1041_018ele", "source_sha256": "bb5ee3b76a85cac260149c560768f287c646467853132fc5aaea1925a8d89160", "ja": "そうなノ？　でもゲキコのおかげで、\nなんだか前に進めそうだヨー！　ありがとネ♪", "zh": "是这样吗？不过多亏了激子，我好像能继续向前迈进了哟——！谢谢你♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0400_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0400_story_03_1042_gekiko", "source_sha256": "48155603a555e41fbd3f3ad4c06f3885879363c2a93251e9ef6a29b4cac7c720", "ja": "うん……。またね。", "zh": "嗯……下次见。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0400_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0400_story_03_1043_029umi", "source_sha256": "07a2c949dd1491b4ca9eeaa382d915da86b3aeda221767a129a2ee5a3133e44a", "ja": "{$P$}、お願いがあるの！", "zh": "{$P$}，我有件事想拜托你！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0400_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0400_story_03_1044_p", "source_sha256": "6981b50ba6d32801ada98d68453ad5db2d46509aa2989250461e3354f105d718", "ja": "海美、それにエレナ？\nどうしたんだ？　今は撮影中じゃ……。", "zh": "海美，还有艾蕾娜？\n怎么了？现在不是正在拍摄吗……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0400_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0400_story_03_1045_018ele", "source_sha256": "16e28aeafe2c016320ce19a46fe280bfc2d06e5aa9baf2bb419ceabbaf622113", "ja": "あのね、今度の定期公演に\nダンス部のみんなを招待したいんだヨー。", "zh": "那个，我想邀请舞蹈部的大家来参加下次的定期公演啦——", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0400_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0400_story_03_1046_p", "source_sha256": "33f41e59f78791aa3ac2f8d82a713f7208eb0ecad354d044243542cb7f293343", "ja": "ダンス部って、美楽留高校の？", "zh": "你说的舞蹈部，是美乐留高中的？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0400_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0400_story_03_1047_018ele", "source_sha256": "81acfdd57dd06a4767a415be69027acf4b38a49869dc5caa37a7f97d9051b9af", "ja": "ウン！", "zh": "嗯！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0400_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0400_story_03_1048_029umi", "source_sha256": "a8fd86d23e2ad8a21912cf51de4a6ff256c07739ed98f9c7e0cd3ef55152f106", "ja": "うん！", "zh": "嗯！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0400_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0400_story_03_1049_p", "source_sha256": "805080b35fcd0224e4486ce68e4a5944261fc7208d1be8a05262652bf47f7833", "ja": "まあ、それは構わないけど。どうして急に？", "zh": "倒是无所谓啦。怎么突然想起来了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0400_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0400_story_03_1050_018ele", "source_sha256": "f4e73954f9bd465a92d283dc8557a58b634737ee1a9a716bd609fe1cf8d8cf8b", "ja": "さっき、アドバイスしてもらえたノ！\nステージを見て、気持ちをひとつにするためにって。", "zh": "刚才有人给我提建议了哦！\n说是为了观看舞台，让大家的心情统一起来。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0400_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0400_story_03_1051_p", "source_sha256": "4d8b9a53d7e3c8fdd9dce6b57fafe269bc3d748f305adaac5ca1be289afeab86", "ja": "アドバイスって……、誰が？", "zh": "你说的建议……是谁给的？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0400_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0400_story_03_1052_029umi", "source_sha256": "b94b909defec9afafdef63522040e340fa375c099b68169cbee96a8548f6f86a", "ja": "それはね～！　それは……あれ、誰だっけ？\n定期公演に招待しようって言ったの。", "zh": "是这样～！是……咦，谁来着？\n是提议邀请来参加定期公演的人。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0400_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0400_story_03_1053_018ele", "source_sha256": "5f23a84e61a799b2f1fe02e3a9c2bdc8fcf0057b314720ab486d3c5926db43f1", "ja": "ワタシじゃないヨ？　でも、ウミでもないよネ？\nアユムもノリコもいなくて、えっと……あれ？", "zh": "不是我哦？但也不是海美吧？\n步和法子也都不在，呃……咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0400_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0400_story_03_1054_p", "source_sha256": "d5e827a531acf55c773d5166267ae235ff4559eb07cd4d65a2eb571455662e4f", "ja": "（この話の流れに既視感が……まさか、劇場の魂！？\n前にもエレナたちに手を貸してくれたんだよな……？）", "zh": "（这剧情走向让我有种似曾相识的感觉……难道是剧场之魂！？之前也曾帮助过艾蕾娜她们吧……？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0400_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0400_story_03_1055_p", "source_sha256": "092c94b418956328b71053214ce20dc8a30c9938ddc32a36a5f583d6c6ffcee2", "ja": "（まあ……、何か助けてくれてるみたいだし。\nここは静観しておくか……）", "zh": "（不过……看来似乎有人在帮忙。\n还是先静观其变吧……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
